{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3n3U58cEuRtLBYPEnN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a small dark eye watching you.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel it — the weight of what is behind me. The faint draft through my keyhole carries something: the smell of old paper, or rain, or a room someone left a long time ago.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*Do you have one?*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}